        {
          "turn_id": 1,
          "text": "The Spring Festival is drawing close . By then we will have five days off . I am expecting it ."
        },
        {
          "turn_id": 3,
          "text": "Just like you celebrate Christmas , we celebrate our lunar New Year's Day , the Spring Festival . It is a time for the family members and relatives to have a get-together ."
        },
        {
          "turn_id": 5,
          "text": "Christmas has more religious nature , while our Spring Festival is a more traditional holiday . On the New Year's Eve , we have a big dinner called ' Family Reunion Dinner ' . One of the traditional food to eat at the dinner is dumplings . After that , the adults usually sit chatting , watching TV , or playing cards ."
        },
        {
          "turn_id": 7,
          "text": "They usually go outside to play firecrackers and fireworks ."
        },
        {
          "turn_id": 9,
          "text": "Perhaps it is like what people told you . At 24 hours midnight , the time when the New Year really comes , we exchange ' Happy New Year ' to each other , and parents and grandparents will take out small packages wrapped with red paper , in them are some what we call ' Lucky Money ."
        },
        {
          "turn_id": 11,
          "text": "Of course the children ."
        }
